      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SASSY DUCHESS (1) jumped from the middle and safely held on debut at Cannington over 381m (23.78). Has the inside box this time. Should be much improved and rates a winning chance. ASTON NEGRONI (2) is overdue for a maiden success having placed at eight of 32 starts, the latest missing the frame when eighth at Mandurah. Tends to run well here despite having never won. Great chance to atone. BLUE DANNI (4) was below best at his last start when 6th at Mandurah following a second place finish (17.90) there two back. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. KEEP WATCHING (8) is still a maiden but is regularly in the top-three.",
